arxiv-2401-04209.description:
A 2024 arXiv research paper by D. Astesiano. We exploit the presence of moduli fields in the
{\rm AdS}_{3}\times{S}^{3}\times CY_{2}
, where
CY_{2}=T^{4}
or
K3
, solution to Type IIB superstring theory, to construct a U-fold solution with geometry
{\rm AdS}_{2}\times S^{1}\times{\rm S}^{3}\times CY_{2}
.
